  "label": "Dumb Jock Stereotype",
  "description": "A cultural stereotype depicting a man who is overly macho, physically imposing, and often portrayed as unintelligent or lacking in sophistication. This stereotype is frequently used in memes to represent someone who is oblivious to social norms or consequences, and is often associated with exaggerated confidence and a dismissive attitude toward criticism. The visual of the man in the green suit with a wide-legged stance and cigarette is a classic representation of this trope.",
